<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Error del servidor | CmDesign</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/img/logo_cmdesign_iso.svg">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background: #0f0f0f;
            color: #ffffff;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .container-500 {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .logo-500 {
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .logo-500 img {
            height: 40px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        
        .error-visual {
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .error-code {
            font-size: clamp(80px, 18vw, 160px);
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .error-code::before {
            content: '500';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9800 0%, #ffb74d 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0.6; }
        }
        
        .gear-icon {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            opacity: 0.15;
            animation: spin 8s linear infinite;
        }
        
        .gear-icon svg {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            fill: #ff9800;
        }
        
        @keyframes spin {
            from { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(0deg); }
            to { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(360deg); }
        }
        
        .floating-icon {
            position: absolute;
            opacity: 0.08;
            animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        
        .floating-icon svg {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            stroke: #ff9800;
            fill: none;
        }
        
        .icon-1 { top: -30%; left: 10%; animation-delay: 0s; }
        .icon-2 { top: 20%; right: 5%; animation-delay: 1.5s; }
        .icon-3 { bottom: 5%; left: 5%; animation-delay: 0.8s; }
        
        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(-5deg); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-15px) rotate(5deg); }
        }
        
        .error-title {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            color: #ff9800;
        }
        
        .error-message {
            color: #9e9e9e;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .error-message strong {
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        
        .status-bar {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            background: rgba(255, 152, 0, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 152, 0, 0.2);
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #ff9800;
        }
        
        .status-dot {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            background: #ff9800;
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: blink 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        
        @keyframes blink {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0.3; }
        }
        
        .error-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        
        .btn-500 {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        
        .btn-primary {
            background: #ff9800;
            color: #0f0f0f;
            border: none;
        }
        
        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #ffb74d;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(255, 152, 0, 0.3);
        }
        
        .btn-secondary {
            background: transparent;
            color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #2d2d2d;
        }
        
        .btn-secondary:hover {
            border-color: #ff9800;
            color: #ff9800;
        }
        
        .bg-pattern {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            pointer-events: none;
            opacity: 0.015;
            background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='60' height='60' viewBox='0 0 60 60' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cg fill='%23ffffff' fill-opacity='1'%3E%3Cpath d='M36 34v-4h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2h-4zm0-30V0h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2V6h4V4h-4zM6 34v-4H4v4H0v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2H6zM6 4V0H4v4H0v2h4v4h2V6h4V4H6z'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E");
        }
        
        .tagline {
            margin-top: 3rem;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: #4a4a4a;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .error-title {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }
            
            .error-actions {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            
            .btn-500 {
                width: 100%;
                justify-content: center;
            }
            
            .status-bar {
                font-size: 0.75rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="bg-pattern"></div>
    
    <div class="floating-icon icon-1">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="floating-icon icon-2">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="floating-icon icon-3">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"/>
        </svg>
    </div>
    
    <div class="container-500">
        <div class="logo-500">
            <img src="/img/logo_cmdesign_white.svg" alt="CmDesign">
        </div>
        
        <div class="error-visual">
            <div class="gear-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path d="M12 15a3 3 0 100-6 3 3 0 000 6z"/>
                    <path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 00.33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 010 2.83 2 2 0 01-2.83 0l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 00-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 00-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 01-2 2 2 2 0 01-2-2v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 009 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 00-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 01-2.83 0 2 2 0 010-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 00.33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 00-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 01-2-2 2 2 0 012-2h.09A1.65 1.65 0 004.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 00-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 010-2.83 2 2 0 012.83 0l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 001.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 001-1.51V3a2 2 0 012-2 2 2 0 012 2v.09a1.65 1.65 0 001 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 001.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 012.83 0 2 2 0 010 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 00-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 001.51 1H21a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 01-2 2h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 00-1.51 1z"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="error-code">500</div>
        </div>
        
        <h1 class="error-title">Error interno</h1>
        
        <p class="error-message">
            Algo salio mal en nuestros servidores.<br>
            <strong>Estamos resolviendo esto</strong>, intenta de nuevo en unos minutos.
        </p>
        
        <div class="status-bar">
            <span class="status-dot"></span>
            <span>Nuestro equipo ya fue notificado</span>
        </div>
        
        <div class="error-actions">
            <a href="/" class="btn-500 btn-primary">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/>
                    <polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/>
                </svg>
                Inicio
            </a>
            <button onclick="location.reload()" class="btn-500 btn-secondary">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"/>
                </svg>
                Reintentar
            </button>
        </div>
        
        <p class="tagline">Moda urbana con actitud</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
